{"about_the_game":"A 2D Action Arcade-like Platformer!<br>Featuring Mexican Battling Bakers Vs Man-Eating Plant Life from OUTER SPACE. <br>Hand drawn, animated, coded, designed, etc, etc by (mostly) one dude. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy simple controls to shoot and melee in different directions. <br></li><li>Shoot to stun enemies, melee them at close range! Hit stunned enemies for MASSIVE DAMAGE!<br></li><li>Fight in locales ranging from one of oldest cities in Mexico to An Alien Spaceship. <br></li><li>Pick up and play gameplay. Pick the controller, punch aliens!<br></li><li>Play solo or with a friend in local co-op. <br></li><li>About 20 short diverse stages for 45 to 60 minutes of breezy, gutsy action! <br></li><li>Replay to get better score! Bring a friend!<br></li><li>Two Characters to choose!<br></li><li>Featuring music by Tokyo Based Music Producer Ghostpops, and City-Pop Sensation Neko Milkshake and the Mex Lo-Fi Legend Palmasur. </li></ul><br><br>* Note on coop: It requires two controllers connected to the same pc for local coop. For remote play, it requires one controller per pc.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Soul Still Burns","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2313180/d0a71c9042bce7987f18669d6dc7aabbc3144c4e.jpg"},{"name":"Church Going","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2313180/d4cf2da85fcf11da0921d6641bdd347887db2ece.jpg"},{"name":"Fine Tuning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2313180/953571f767fd3801f738237de707499420b29e75.jpg"},{"name":"Guardian of the City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2313180/1c9eab7489a0d6a840449f81f6f483001654ef42.jpg"},{"name":"Four Bars?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2313180/436e996f608f5a0ec0da1da6e295e1cb2f649cb3.jpg"},{"name":"Extremely shy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.